1
00:01:32,750 --> 00:01:35,030
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,110 --> 00:01:37,570
[Episode 24]

3
00:01:44,789 --> 00:01:46,350
I know why you came to see me.

4
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:49,200
I've read the case file.

5
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,229
There are indeed some questionable points,

6
00:01:50,229 --> 00:01:51,630
which is why I came to you.

7
00:01:52,039 --> 00:01:52,970
The police won't

8
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,400
show me the investigation subsidiary file

9
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,759
Then what do you want to know?

10
00:01:57,759 --> 00:01:59,220
There are several things.

11
00:01:59,229 --> 00:02:00,560
For example,
why wasn't the DNA test result

12
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,350
included in

13
00:02:01,380 --> 00:02:02,310
the indictment?

14
00:02:02,890 --> 00:02:04,000
The DNA test technology

15
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,230
has only been around for a few years.

16
00:02:05,230 --> 00:02:07,640
The test results can only
be used as reference.

17
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,370
Do you agree?

18
00:02:08,710 --> 00:02:09,360
I agree.

19
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:13,040
So you trust confessions more?

20
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:15,430
What's wrong?

21
00:02:16,230 --> 00:02:17,890
Are confessions unreliable?

22
00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:20,079
I think a confession
corroborated by witness, physical,

23
00:02:20,079 --> 00:02:21,360
and biological evidence

24
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,960
is more reliable.

25
00:02:26,140 --> 00:02:27,079
The DNA test showed

26
00:02:27,079 --> 00:02:28,140
that the biological tissue
in eight of the victim's fingernails

27
00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:29,829
does not belong to Yan Jicai,

28
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:32,370
nor does it belong to anyone involved.

29
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,960
It was from an unknown perpetrator.

30
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,750
When I was studying,

31
00:02:35,750 --> 00:02:36,710
I learned a term

32
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,280
called the dual relevance of evidence.

33
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,840
I don't understand what you're saying.

34
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,900
Let me ask you this,

35
00:02:42,079 --> 00:02:43,360
is it possible that the skin tissue

36
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,520
found under the victim's

37
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,920
fingernails has nothing

38
00:02:46,190 --> 00:02:47,320
to do with this case?

39
00:02:48,079 --> 00:02:48,940
It's possible.

40
00:02:50,910 --> 00:02:52,240
At least you're honest.

41
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:54,570
Captain Lyu,

42
00:02:56,310 --> 00:02:57,030
there's something

43
00:02:57,030 --> 00:02:58,890
that wouldn't be in the case file,

44
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,770
but Yan Jicai has mentioned it
several times.

45
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,190
What?

46
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:06,260
He was beaten during the interrogation.

47
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,280
Did you or anyone else

48
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,710
lay a hand on him?

49
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:16,440
Was there any torture
to extract a confession?

50
00:03:20,150 --> 00:03:21,079
I don't recall.

51
00:03:26,430 --> 00:03:27,590
What happened?

52
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,310
Just listen to me for a second.

53
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:31,280
I'm not at home.

54
00:03:32,150 --> 00:03:32,560
You...

55
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:36,520
Hello.

56
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,310
Are you here for

57
00:03:38,310 --> 00:03:39,240
legal services?

58
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,500
I'm looking for Attorney Qin.

59
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,380
Business or personal?

60
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:44,520
Divorce.

61
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:45,910
Our firm has plenty of

62
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:47,470
lawyers who handle divorce cases.

63
00:03:47,470 --> 00:03:48,840
Mr. Qin isn't here right now.

64
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,910
Here I am.

65
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,700
Looking for me?

66
00:03:51,710 --> 00:03:52,510
Attorney Qin.

67
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:53,800
I finally found you.

68
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,329
This way.

69
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:54,960
Please.

70
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,570
To my office.

71
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,710
3,000?

72
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,360
The price is clearly marked.

73
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:02,910
3,000.

74
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:06,100
I-I'm just getting a divorce,

75
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,600
and you want 3,000?

76
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,560
My husband doesn't even

77
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,840
have 3,000 in savings.

78
00:04:11,530 --> 00:04:13,810
But there's also child custody

79
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,040
and the house, right?

80
00:04:15,150 --> 00:04:16,750
Those are mine to begin with!

81
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:19,920
Oh my goodness.

82
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:22,530
You're a famous lawyer, sure,

83
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:25,000
but you can't just bleed me dry.

84
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:26,870
What are you talking about?

85
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:29,970
I've defended cases alongside Yuan Yifang.

86
00:04:29,970 --> 00:04:31,570
I've been in the newspapers.

87
00:04:32,110 --> 00:04:33,830
Lawyers at my level

88
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,600
charge this rate.

89
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:37,360
Who's Yuan Lifang?

90
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,480
Yuan Yifang

91
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,650
is the most famous lawyer in China.

92
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,600
I'm just getting a divorce.

93
00:04:45,970 --> 00:04:48,230
I don't need a nationally famous lawyer.

94
00:04:48,870 --> 00:04:49,470
Forget it.

95
00:04:49,830 --> 00:04:51,090
I'll find someone cheaper.

96
00:04:51,090 --> 00:04:51,800
Wait.

97
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,880
I'll give you a discount.

98
00:04:58,070 --> 00:04:58,950
2,800. Deal?

99
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:02,800
Stop.

100
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,280
Let me go talk

101
00:05:06,310 --> 00:05:07,160
to my partner.

102
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,250
Wait here. Don't leave.

103
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,070
Qin,

104
00:05:23,710 --> 00:05:25,310
that woman's about to leave.

105
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,480
I talked it over with my partner.

106
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:39,830
2,000.

107
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,360
It's the lowest I can go.

108
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:41,950
And

109
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,360
I'll throw in 24/7

110
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:46,190
phone consultation.

111
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,980
That's a good deal.

112
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:48,870
500.

113
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,310
Are you kidding me?

114
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:55,750
350.

115
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:57,920
Seriously?

116
00:05:57,950 --> 00:05:59,480
Are you here to mess with me?

117
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:02,920
Attorney Qin,

118
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,630
I have a whole group

119
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:06,830
of girlfriends who also want divorces.

120
00:06:07,180 --> 00:06:08,450
I'll refer them

121
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,360
to you.

122
00:06:09,950 --> 00:06:11,360
You give me a break,

123
00:06:11,550 --> 00:06:12,720
and you can charge them more.

124
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,780
I won't tell a soul.

125
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:14,480
Deal?

126
00:06:25,070 --> 00:06:25,600
Really?

127
00:06:26,750 --> 00:06:27,430
450.

128
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,080
Let's sign the contract.

129
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:44,420
[Binjiang Intermediate People's Court]

130
00:06:52,870 --> 00:06:53,270
Hello?

131
00:06:54,830 --> 00:06:55,270
Hello?

132
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:01,060
You've been through so much.

133
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:02,320
Why didn't you tell me?

134
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:04,470
Didn't want you to worry.

135
00:07:04,510 --> 00:07:06,280
Once I wrap up this seminar,

136
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,220
I'll go see you.

137
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,070
Yizhong.

138
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,240
I...

139
00:07:09,310 --> 00:07:09,850
It's fine.

140
00:07:09,850 --> 00:07:11,210
If it's not a good time,

141
00:07:11,870 --> 00:07:12,750
I can hold off.

142
00:07:13,540 --> 00:07:14,590
Just let me know

143
00:07:14,610 --> 00:07:15,240
when you're ready,

144
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,240
and I'll be there.

145
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,360
Chen Yizhong,

146
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,450
do you want to be with me?

147
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:26,600
Yes.

148
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,140
If we're together,

149
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,360
you might have to put up with a lot

150
00:07:33,870 --> 00:07:35,600
and encounter a lot of trouble.

151
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,800
Maybe

152
00:07:37,890 --> 00:07:39,750
even your career could take a hit.

153
00:07:39,950 --> 00:07:41,240
I'm not exactly the easy,

154
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,190
compliant type.

155
00:07:44,870 --> 00:07:46,330
What are you trying to say?

156
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:49,720
I thought

157
00:07:49,750 --> 00:07:50,750
I didn't need you,

158
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:53,120
or any man.

159
00:07:56,930 --> 00:07:58,310
But saying all this isn't fair to you.

160
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,370
I've been selfish.

161
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:02,070
Y-You don't have to say all that.

162
00:08:02,890 --> 00:08:04,550
Just say what you really mean.

163
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:07,680
Maybe

164
00:08:08,110 --> 00:08:10,160
we could give it a try,

165
00:08:11,070 --> 00:08:12,470
if you're still willing.

166
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,270
I...

167
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,680
I-I've only recently realized

168
00:08:21,950 --> 00:08:24,150
that you're actually pretty insecure.

169
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,050
I'm afraid—

170
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:28,730
Afraid it's not guaranteed sweet, right?

171
00:08:29,010 --> 00:08:30,840
Am I buying a watermelon

172
00:08:30,870 --> 00:08:31,670
or something?

173
00:08:33,210 --> 00:08:34,510
I'm pretending to be calm here,

174
00:08:34,510 --> 00:08:35,970
but my palms are sweating.

175
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,270
I'm afraid

176
00:08:38,549 --> 00:08:40,000
if it doesn't work out,

177
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:41,510
I'll lose

178
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:42,770
a good friend like you.

179
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,380
That won't happen.

180
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:47,200
Even if we don't end up

181
00:08:48,390 --> 00:08:49,270
together,

182
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:51,030
we'll always

183
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:52,160
be friends for life.

184
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:54,790
But I won't let you

185
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:55,910
break up with me.

186
00:09:02,910 --> 00:09:03,480
Lihui.

187
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,810
I'm heading to the courthouse.

188
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:08,550
The Chief Prosecutor summoned me urgently.

189
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:09,600
Is it good news or bad?

190
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,440
No idea.

191
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,150
You see,

192
00:09:13,140 --> 00:09:13,960
we've been sending reports

193
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,820
up the chain pretty often lately.

194
00:09:16,790 --> 00:09:18,450
There are two possibilities.

195
00:09:18,510 --> 00:09:19,960
They either make a move

196
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,870
or make us stop.

197
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,280
So do you think it's move or stop?

198
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,270
Hard to say.

199
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:32,150
Mentor,

200
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,440
how many days of leave do I have left?

201
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,120
Why?

202
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:36,880
I want to go to Nanlu.

203
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,600
Nanlu?

204
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:39,840
I don't have a pager.

205
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,840
You can't reach me

206
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:42,320
unless I call you.

207
00:09:44,130 --> 00:09:44,960
As for this matter,

208
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,420
whether it's move or stop,

209
00:09:46,630 --> 00:09:48,230
let's wait until I come back.

210
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:51,720
Okay.

211
00:09:52,790 --> 00:09:54,050
Write a leave request.

212
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,440
I'll approve it.

213
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:56,360
Okay.

214
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:05,320
Man.

215
00:10:05,870 --> 00:10:07,070
This is interesting.

216
00:10:07,390 --> 00:10:08,630
Tell me about it.

217
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:11,080
We're trying to overturn
a case for someone else,

218
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:13,940
but it feels like we're
the ones committing a crime.

219
00:10:54,510 --> 00:10:56,640
Jianmin, why were you running so fast?

220
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:57,660
Please,

221
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:58,870
put in a leave request for me.

222
00:10:58,870 --> 00:10:59,810
I owe you a meal.

223
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,700
I owe you a meal.

224
00:11:00,750 --> 00:11:01,550
Thank you.

225
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:04,050
I just sorted these out.

226
00:11:19,550 --> 00:11:20,080
Lihui.

227
00:11:24,790 --> 00:11:26,320
Have you been waiting long?

228
00:11:26,750 --> 00:11:27,480
Just a while.

229
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:28,840
Lihui.

230
00:11:30,630 --> 00:11:32,030
I've been waiting for you

231
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:33,980
for a long time.

232
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,790
A-Am I being too forward?

233
00:11:45,750 --> 00:11:46,870
M-Mr. Guo hasn't

234
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,080
t-told you yet?

235
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:50,790
I...

236
00:11:50,810 --> 00:11:51,840
I-I thought

237
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,310
he had already—

238
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:53,910
Well,

239
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:57,480
I-I'm a little hungry.

240
00:11:58,630 --> 00:11:59,150
Right.

241
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:01,870
You must be hungry
after the train ride.

242
00:12:01,870 --> 00:12:02,670
T-Then let's go to

243
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:04,530
your favorite rice noodle place.

244
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:06,970
Caiji Noodle House is fine.

245
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:08,440
Okay.

246
00:12:11,030 --> 00:12:12,360
Carry my luggage for me.

247
00:12:13,630 --> 00:12:14,030
Okay.

248
00:12:19,390 --> 00:12:19,840
Here you go.

249
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,240
Thank you.

250
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:20,650
Your noodles.

251
00:12:20,650 --> 00:12:21,250
Thank you.

252
00:12:21,790 --> 00:12:22,390
Thank you.

253
00:12:25,630 --> 00:12:26,390
Thank you.

254
00:12:27,150 --> 00:12:28,910
You're really pretty.

255
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:30,320
Madam.

256
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:31,270
This...

257
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:32,550
How can we eat all this?

258
00:12:32,550 --> 00:12:33,680
It's going to waste.

259
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,510
I don't have much to offer.

260
00:12:36,510 --> 00:12:38,030
Just take it as my treat.

261
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:40,120
Help yourselves.

262
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:40,630
Well...

263
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,840
Go inside and do your homework.

264
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,170
The adults need to talk.

265
00:12:49,150 --> 00:12:49,810
Have a seat.

266
00:12:54,670 --> 00:12:55,750
This photo of him

267
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,580
was taken recently.

268
00:13:11,060 --> 00:13:11,670
Thank you.

269
00:13:16,370 --> 00:13:17,100
How did he...

270
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:29,960
Thanks.

271
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,070
Thank you.

272
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:42,030
Dad.

273
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:44,910
Judge Xia!

274
00:13:45,270 --> 00:13:46,120
Judge Xia!

275
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:51,750
Mr. Hu.

276
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,750
What are you doing here?

277
00:13:55,750 --> 00:13:56,350
Waiting for you.

278
00:13:56,350 --> 00:13:58,130
We've been here since noon.

279
00:13:58,340 --> 00:13:58,960
Why didn't you ask

280
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:00,080
the gatehouse to call me?

281
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:00,940
We didn't dare.

282
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,860
What do you need me for?

283
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:05,840
Judge Xia,

284
00:14:07,270 --> 00:14:08,080
let's go over there.

285
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,680
I need to tell you something.

286
00:14:09,690 --> 00:14:10,200
No need.

287
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:11,130
Just say it here.

288
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,040
It's fine.

289
00:14:12,150 --> 00:14:12,750
Judge Xia.

290
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:14,870
What are you doing?

291
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:15,410
Get up.

292
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,030
Listen to me.

293
00:14:16,030 --> 00:14:16,740
Get up first.

294
00:14:16,740 --> 00:14:18,200
Don't make a scene out here, alright!

295
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,460
This is all your fault.

296
00:14:19,630 --> 00:14:21,030
Wait, what are you doing?

297
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,410
I'm calling the police.

298
00:14:23,050 --> 00:14:23,680
I'm sorry.

299
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:26,030
Judge Xia.

300
00:14:27,550 --> 00:14:27,910
I...

301
00:14:28,390 --> 00:14:28,990
Calm down.

302
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,080
Take your time.

303
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:30,510
Okay?

304
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:32,920
I really have no other choice

305
00:14:33,870 --> 00:14:34,570
but to come to you.

306
00:14:34,570 --> 00:14:35,910
You're the only one I know.

307
00:14:35,910 --> 00:14:37,200
Can you please help us?

308
00:14:37,420 --> 00:14:39,270
Hu Xudong is innocent.

309
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:41,900
Whether Hu Xudong is innocent or not

310
00:14:41,900 --> 00:14:42,900
isn't up to you.

311
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,570
It depends on the evidence.

312
00:14:44,570 --> 00:14:45,200
I know.

313
00:14:45,510 --> 00:14:46,080
I know.

314
00:14:46,270 --> 00:14:47,790
Hu Xudong has already been arrested.

315
00:14:47,790 --> 00:14:49,000
The notice from the procuratorate

316
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:49,840
has arrived.

317
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,800
They're going to prosecute.

318
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,300
We're just country folks.

319
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:53,980
We're timid

320
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,550
and don't know anything.

321
00:14:55,550 --> 00:14:57,390
We never imagined
we'd ever be involved in a lawsuit,

322
00:14:57,390 --> 00:14:58,720
let alone a murder case.

323
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:00,120
Please help us.

324
00:15:00,810 --> 00:15:01,600
Whether Xudong

325
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:03,000
is truly innocent or not,

326
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:05,340
at least point us in the right direction.

327
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,450
Have you found a lawyer?

328
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:09,870
A lawyer?

329
00:15:10,850 --> 00:15:11,690
What lawyer?

330
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:12,440
I told you,

331
00:15:12,460 --> 00:15:14,270
the one who'd help
my brother with his lawsuit.

332
00:15:14,270 --> 00:15:14,750
Shut up.

333
00:15:16,030 --> 00:15:17,030
We don't know

334
00:15:17,030 --> 00:15:18,480
where to find a lawyer.

335
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,390
That's okay.

336
00:15:20,730 --> 00:15:21,910
The government will appoint

337
00:15:21,910 --> 00:15:23,320
a legal aid lawyer.

338
00:15:23,870 --> 00:15:24,670
It's free.

339
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:26,630
How can that be reliable?

340
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:27,720
Judge Xia,

341
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,200
how can you hand our

342
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:29,960
son's life over to—

343
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:30,630
Dad, stop.

344
00:15:30,650 --> 00:15:31,700
Someone else?

345
00:15:31,810 --> 00:15:33,740
I'm not handing him over to anyone.

346
00:15:34,090 --> 00:15:35,000
Getting a lawyer

347
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,500
is a normal legal procedure.

348
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:37,900
The lawyer will help you.

349
00:15:38,190 --> 00:15:38,670
Understand?

350
00:15:38,670 --> 00:15:40,630
Does this have nothing to do with you?

351
00:15:40,630 --> 00:15:40,960
Dad.

352
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:41,720
Does this have nothing to do with you?

353
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:42,770
We came to see Judge Xia—

354
00:15:42,770 --> 00:15:43,720
Didn't you cause this trouble?

355
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:44,750
Just say no more!

356
00:15:44,860 --> 00:15:46,320
We have to trust Judge Xia.

357
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,500
Did you let Yin Ping go?

358
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:48,760
Trust Judge Xia, okay?

359
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:49,840
Go, go.

360
00:15:50,490 --> 00:15:51,120
Alright, stop talking.

361
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,870
You were the one who let Yin Ping go!

362
00:15:52,870 --> 00:15:53,460
Stop talking.

363
00:15:53,460 --> 00:15:54,270
Wasn't it?

364
00:15:54,300 --> 00:15:54,790
Xia.

365
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:56,550
If you hadn't let Yin Ping go—

366
00:15:56,870 --> 00:15:57,600
Are you okay?

367
00:15:57,870 --> 00:15:58,600
I'm fine.

368
00:16:01,870 --> 00:16:03,080
Calm down.

369
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:06,390
Mr. Hu, I've told you everything I can.

370
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:09,000
Stop talking.

371
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:09,440
Judge Xia!

372
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:10,080
Dad.

373
00:16:10,870 --> 00:16:11,550
Go away.

374
00:16:11,750 --> 00:16:12,440
Stop talking.

375
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,320
Judge Xia!

376
00:16:14,670 --> 00:16:15,550
Judge Xia!

377
00:16:15,870 --> 00:16:17,670
Three lives gone!

378
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,630
Judge Xia, it's because of you!

379
00:16:19,630 --> 00:16:20,150
Stop.

380
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:22,070
How can you live with yourself?

381
00:16:22,070 --> 00:16:23,720
Alright, Dad, stop it.

382
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:25,880
Can you live with yourself, Judge Xia?

383
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,000
Guiya,

384
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:33,870
we'll be leaving now.

385
00:16:34,150 --> 00:16:36,010
Prosecutor Zhang, wait a moment.

386
00:16:37,390 --> 00:16:38,450
Prosecutor Zhang,

387
00:16:38,950 --> 00:16:39,880
our whole family

388
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,160
is so grateful to you.

389
00:16:42,630 --> 00:16:43,960
Don't mention it.

390
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,870
It's my duty.

391
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,120
If I didn't do my best,

392
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:48,650
I wouldn't be able to sleep.

393
00:16:50,170 --> 00:16:51,570
We really appreciate it.

394
00:16:52,050 --> 00:16:53,080
Oh, there's something

395
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:54,210
I forgot to tell you.

396
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:56,030
A few days ago,
that criminal police captain

397
00:16:56,030 --> 00:16:56,870
from the public security bureau

398
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:57,470
came here.

399
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:58,920
Which one?

400
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:00,480
The one surnamed Lyu.

401
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,210
Captain Lyu.

402
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:03,940
Are you sure?

403
00:17:04,310 --> 00:17:04,790
Yes.

404
00:17:05,730 --> 00:17:06,410
He's the one

405
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:07,589
who arrested Jicai back then.

406
00:17:07,589 --> 00:17:09,190
Always had that gloomy face.

407
00:17:09,829 --> 00:17:10,400
He wasn't

408
00:17:10,430 --> 00:17:11,119
in uniform this time,

409
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:11,790
but I recognized him

410
00:17:11,790 --> 00:17:12,510
right away.

411
00:17:12,829 --> 00:17:14,109
He looked older, thinner,

412
00:17:14,109 --> 00:17:15,510
with a lot more grey hair.

413
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,109
Still had that same unhappy look, though.

414
00:17:17,109 --> 00:17:18,250
What did he come for?

415
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:19,300
To eat noodles.

416
00:17:19,750 --> 00:17:20,960
He thought I wouldn't remember him.

417
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:22,400
He just ate noodles and said nothing?

418
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:22,930
Nothing.

419
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:24,640
He finished and left.

420
00:17:25,079 --> 00:17:26,430
Mom wanted to spit

421
00:17:26,450 --> 00:17:27,150
in his bowl,

422
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:28,400
but I stopped her.

423
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:30,380
I said that wouldn't be right.

424
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,400
You talk too much.

425
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:33,330
Well,

426
00:17:33,830 --> 00:17:34,960
we'll get going now.

427
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:35,830
Okay.

428
00:17:36,110 --> 00:17:36,510
Okay.

429
00:17:36,590 --> 00:17:37,020
See you.

430
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:37,720
I'll leave you to it.

431
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:38,320
Take care.

432
00:17:38,550 --> 00:17:38,830
Okay.

433
00:17:38,830 --> 00:17:40,000
Thank you for everything.

434
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:40,600
Not at all.

435
00:17:44,550 --> 00:17:45,750
Didn't you say Captain Lyu

436
00:17:45,750 --> 00:17:46,960
was really resistant?

437
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:47,920
He was.

438
00:17:48,510 --> 00:17:50,030
When I asked about confession by torture,

439
00:17:50,030 --> 00:17:51,160
the look in his eyes—

440
00:17:51,370 --> 00:17:52,970
I swear he wanted to punch me.

441
00:17:54,530 --> 00:17:55,160
So he probably

442
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:57,560
didn't just show up by coincidence, right?

443
00:17:57,770 --> 00:17:58,350
I think he might

444
00:17:58,350 --> 00:17:59,880
actually be a breakthrough.

445
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:00,510
Why?

446
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:02,910
He's an old-school detective.

447
00:18:02,910 --> 00:18:03,750
He wouldn't just wander

448
00:18:03,750 --> 00:18:05,080
over here for no reason.

449
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:06,660
At the very least,
I think he's been thinking

450
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:07,990
about what I said to him.

451
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:11,310
I've been thinking about
what you said to me too.

452
00:18:11,310 --> 00:18:12,440
That line you said

453
00:18:12,590 --> 00:18:13,440
really hit me.

454
00:18:14,110 --> 00:18:14,710
Which one?

455
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:17,600
You told me to believe

456
00:18:17,830 --> 00:18:18,750
that no one

457
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,200
wants to have a wrongful

458
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,730
conviction on their hands.

459
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:25,640
You have to look at it from both sides.

460
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,640
It's best if it wasn't intentional

461
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:27,680
beforehand, of course.

462
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,200
But if they refuse to admit it afterwards,

463
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:30,860
it's even harder to deal with.

464
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,200
I believe in people's basic decency.

465
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:34,600
I'll go see him tomorrow.

466
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:35,070
Okay.

467
00:18:36,880 --> 00:18:37,550
Thank you

468
00:18:37,830 --> 00:18:39,430
for setting the stage for me,

469
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:40,480
otherwise I'd be

470
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,450
going in blind.

471
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:43,590
Really appreciate your help.

472
00:18:43,590 --> 00:18:44,240
Mister.

473
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:46,270
Your girlfriend is so pretty.

474
00:18:46,470 --> 00:18:48,100
Would you buy her a rose?

475
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,460
Who taught you to say that?

476
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:51,920
You're so smooth.

477
00:18:52,390 --> 00:18:53,400
She's not my girlfriend.

478
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,200
She's my boss.

479
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:55,410
Right.

480
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,920
I'm not his girlfriend yet.

481
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,200
I can't have these flowers.

482
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:58,800
Thank you.

483
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,170
Hurry, let's go.

484
00:19:01,350 --> 00:19:02,880
Just buy one.

485
00:19:08,010 --> 00:19:08,580
Lin!

486
00:19:09,070 --> 00:19:09,550
Lin!

487
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,200
Prosecutor Xu called

488
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:12,960
looking for you.

489
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,400
He wants you to get over there right away.

490
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:15,200
Okay.

491
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:16,260
Alright, bye.

492
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:22,610
Prosecutor Xu.

493
00:19:22,690 --> 00:19:23,630
Come in quickly.

494
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:24,310
Have a seat.

495
00:19:24,310 --> 00:19:24,640
Okay.

496
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:26,440
Calling me in at this time,

497
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,100
it must be something serious.

498
00:19:30,750 --> 00:19:32,080
You're taking this one.

499
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:34,160
The circumstances are severe
and the nature is egregious.

500
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:35,420
The impact is very bad.

501
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:37,340
The victim is disabled.

502
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:39,350
The family member was so devastated

503
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:40,750
that she hanged herself.

504
00:19:41,070 --> 00:19:42,670
The old lady was 78 years old.

505
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:44,120
One case, two lives lost.

506
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,210
Public outrage is high.

507
00:19:46,550 --> 00:19:47,830
I know about this case.

508
00:19:48,110 --> 00:19:49,840
It happened just a few days ago.

509
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:51,880
Committed by an acquaintance.
Obvious motive.

510
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:53,940
The pool of suspects is very limited.

511
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:55,110
They zeroed in within two days,

512
00:19:55,110 --> 00:19:56,480
and the confession came in shortly after.

513
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:58,030
You're the most reliable
in the procuratorate.

514
00:19:58,030 --> 00:19:59,400
That's why we came to you.

515
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,530
I don't want another

516
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:02,840
Qian Xingliang situation on our hands.

517
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:05,400
I appreciate your trust.

518
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:07,160
I understand.

519
00:20:07,790 --> 00:20:09,790
I'll go back and review the case files.

520
00:20:09,790 --> 00:20:11,310
Then move on it quickly.

521
00:20:11,830 --> 00:20:12,200
Okay.

522
00:20:13,680 --> 00:20:14,070
Okay.

523
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:14,770
Okay.

524
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:25,620
By the way, Prosecutor Xu—

525
00:20:25,750 --> 00:20:26,680
If by any chance,

526
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:28,160
I mean, if by any chance,

527
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,240
can we return the case file

528
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:31,070
and request supplementary investigation?

529
00:20:31,070 --> 00:20:32,870
Stability first, speed second.

530
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,160
Do what needs to be done.

531
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:35,590
Understood, Prosecutor Xu.

532
00:20:35,590 --> 00:20:35,920
Okay.

533
00:20:43,510 --> 00:20:44,170
We're here.

534
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:46,160
You can go back first.

535
00:20:48,590 --> 00:20:49,590
See you tomorrow then.

536
00:20:49,590 --> 00:20:50,920
Okay, see you tomorrow.

537
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:02,200
What's wrong?

538
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:05,650
This card seems broken.

539
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:07,880
I should ask the front desk for a new one.

540
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:09,000
Let me see.

541
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:12,310
Or maybe

542
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:14,370
I've been in prison for too long

543
00:21:14,850 --> 00:21:16,180
and become out of touch.

544
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:23,670
These magnetic cards do that sometimes.

545
00:21:23,670 --> 00:21:25,270
Honestly, keys were easier.

546
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:31,400
Lihui.

547
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:38,860
This is for you.

548
00:21:42,550 --> 00:21:43,310
It's broken.

549
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:46,600
When did you get this?

550
00:21:51,380 --> 00:21:52,980
Just when you turned around.

551
00:21:55,070 --> 00:21:56,550
Just when I turned around,

552
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:58,510
you bought me a flower?

553
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:02,830
How do you always

554
00:22:03,830 --> 00:22:04,750
make me so happy

555
00:22:05,550 --> 00:22:07,290
and surprise me?

556
00:22:10,750 --> 00:22:11,810
Will you accept it?

557
00:22:14,830 --> 00:22:15,400
Yes.

558
00:22:21,920 --> 00:22:23,030
Isn't it nice?

559
00:22:29,350 --> 00:22:29,960
Come in.

560
00:22:31,590 --> 00:22:32,050
Really?

561
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:36,800
Help me bring the luggage in.

562
00:22:53,030 --> 00:22:53,890
Not going home?

563
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:55,830
I don't want to.

564
00:22:58,160 --> 00:22:58,830
How are things

565
00:22:58,830 --> 00:22:59,960
with your daughter?

566
00:23:00,070 --> 00:23:00,960
Not so good.

567
00:23:04,960 --> 00:23:05,440
Qin.

568
00:23:07,110 --> 00:23:08,570
Let me give you a heads-up.

569
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:09,640
What?

570
00:23:11,750 --> 00:23:13,880
You can't lower your prices like this.

571
00:23:14,270 --> 00:23:15,330
If you keep this up,

572
00:23:15,810 --> 00:23:16,880
the other lawyers in our firm

573
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:18,740
won't be able to charge normally.

574
00:23:22,070 --> 00:23:22,510
Why?

575
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:26,060
Am I getting in the way of their money?

576
00:23:37,790 --> 00:23:39,390
Fought with your wife again?

577
00:23:42,700 --> 00:23:44,700
Usually, husbands hit their wives.

578
00:23:46,520 --> 00:23:48,580
In my case, the wife hits the husband.

579
00:23:53,350 --> 00:23:54,000
Qin.

580
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,000
For a case,

581
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,550
you charge 450 yuan,

582
00:23:58,330 --> 00:23:59,720
and provide 24/7

583
00:23:59,750 --> 00:24:01,080
on-call consultation.

584
00:24:01,310 --> 00:24:03,170
Do you think that's appropriate?

585
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:04,000
Yeah.

586
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:06,880
I defended your case,

587
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:09,510
became a province-famous

588
00:24:09,510 --> 00:24:10,350
lawyer.

589
00:24:10,830 --> 00:24:12,230
And that's all I'm worth?

590
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:16,650
That's what people are saying.

591
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:19,070
You think so too?

592
00:24:20,510 --> 00:24:22,030
We're a law firm.

593
00:24:22,510 --> 00:24:24,240
We need to be professional
and to make a profit.

594
