887
00:36:01,760 --> 00:36:03,160
I won't make it.

888
00:36:03,590 --> 00:36:05,230
So I don't blame her.

889
00:36:05,720 --> 00:36:07,200
And I'm not jealous of her.

890
00:36:07,230 --> 00:36:08,030
Even if she wasn't selected,

891
00:36:08,030 --> 00:36:10,070
it wouldn't be my turn anyway.

892
00:36:10,330 --> 00:36:11,000
Then let's quit.

893
00:36:11,000 --> 00:36:12,130
Let's go home, okay?

894
00:36:12,860 --> 00:36:14,990
Let's stop training and go home, okay?

895
00:36:15,630 --> 00:36:16,560
Don't move, kid.

896
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:18,280
Give me your hand.

897
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:20,290
Give me your hand, okay?

898
00:36:20,920 --> 00:36:23,030
You won't listen to me.

899
00:36:23,190 --> 00:36:24,280
Don't move. Don't.

900
00:36:24,710 --> 00:36:26,030
You've been like this since I was little.

901
00:36:26,030 --> 00:36:28,190
You never listen to me.

902
00:36:29,120 --> 00:36:29,970
In your heart,

903
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:31,420
those cases matter more than I do.

904
00:36:31,420 --> 00:36:33,740
And so do those murderers.

905
00:36:35,440 --> 00:36:36,150
I was wrong.

906
00:36:36,710 --> 00:36:37,670
It was my fault.

907
00:36:38,940 --> 00:36:40,270
Y-You're still a child.

908
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:41,720
You still have time for everything.

909
00:36:41,720 --> 00:36:42,810
It's too late.

910
00:36:42,840 --> 00:36:44,500
It's too late for everything.

911
00:36:44,960 --> 00:36:46,000
They all say

912
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:47,880
that I harmed Wang Danni.

913
00:36:48,330 --> 00:36:49,970
No one said that, Siyi.

914
00:36:50,000 --> 00:36:51,110
No one said that.

915
00:36:51,370 --> 00:36:51,800
Siyi.

916
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:53,550
Everyone is thinking it.

917
00:36:53,960 --> 00:36:55,000
Including you,

918
00:36:55,180 --> 00:36:55,910
Coach Sun,

919
00:36:56,070 --> 00:36:56,630
right?

920
00:36:57,480 --> 00:36:59,360
Things will get cleared up.

921
00:36:59,450 --> 00:37:00,280
They won't.

922
00:37:00,320 --> 00:37:01,920
Siyi! Siyi!

923
00:37:02,670 --> 00:37:03,400
Siyi!

924
00:37:04,360 --> 00:37:05,000
Sweetheart.

925
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:05,460
Calm down.

926
00:37:05,460 --> 00:37:06,600
You're my life.

927
00:37:06,630 --> 00:37:08,150
Calm down. Calm down.

928
00:37:08,760 --> 00:37:09,760
What are you doing?

929
00:37:09,760 --> 00:37:10,320
Stop shouting.

930
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:11,320
Stop arguing!

931
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,320
You're my life.

932
00:37:12,360 --> 00:37:13,800
Stop arguing!

933
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:14,740
Lyu Tiancheng!

934
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:15,940
It's been like this since childhood.

935
00:37:15,940 --> 00:37:18,340
You two argue
every time you see each other!

936
00:37:18,710 --> 00:37:20,040
Neither of you is wrong.

937
00:37:20,230 --> 00:37:21,230
It's my fault!

938
00:37:21,250 --> 00:37:21,980
Come down, Siyi.

939
00:37:21,980 --> 00:37:22,720
I can't live without you.

940
00:37:22,720 --> 00:37:23,480
I shouldn't have been born!

941
00:37:23,480 --> 00:37:25,010
I shouldn't have been born!

942
00:37:25,320 --> 00:37:26,120
Stop yelling.

943
00:38:07,320 --> 00:38:07,920
Excuse me.

944
00:38:07,940 --> 00:38:08,870
Coming through.

945
00:38:36,710 --> 00:38:37,750
Why are you here?

946
00:38:38,920 --> 00:38:39,720
You're awake.

947
00:38:41,280 --> 00:38:42,140
How do you feel?

948
00:38:49,150 --> 00:38:50,680
How long have I been asleep?

949
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:52,110
Not too long.

950
00:38:52,510 --> 00:38:53,370
You woke up once

951
00:38:53,510 --> 00:38:55,370
and started looking for your mom.

952
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:57,710
Really? I was looking for my mom?

953
00:39:01,810 --> 00:39:02,550
Is there drool

954
00:39:02,550 --> 00:39:03,880
all over my face?

955
00:39:05,440 --> 00:39:07,070
I already wiped it off for you.

956
00:39:07,070 --> 00:39:07,710
You did?

957
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:08,510
Yeah.

958
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:10,690
Why didn't you let a nurse do it?

959
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:14,610
Wanna see me embarrass myself?

960
00:39:14,710 --> 00:39:16,800
Alright, I'll go get a nurse for you.

961
00:39:24,320 --> 00:39:25,000
Miss,

962
00:39:26,710 --> 00:39:29,190
your boyfriend really
knows how to take care of you.

963
00:39:29,190 --> 00:39:30,390
You've got a good one.

964
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:32,050
He's been here

965
00:39:32,110 --> 00:39:33,800
taking care of you for two days.

966
00:39:33,800 --> 00:39:34,670
Two days?

967
00:39:35,630 --> 00:39:36,400
Exactly.

968
00:39:37,010 --> 00:39:37,710
He hasn't slept much

969
00:39:37,710 --> 00:39:38,840
these past two days.

970
00:39:41,550 --> 00:39:43,840
Is his name Chen Yizhong?

971
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:46,320
How did you know?

972
00:39:47,230 --> 00:39:48,290
Then that's right.

973
00:39:48,800 --> 00:39:50,110
While you were asleep,

974
00:39:50,230 --> 00:39:51,510
you kept calling for your mom

975
00:39:51,510 --> 00:39:52,360
and for him.

976
00:39:52,800 --> 00:39:54,190
More than once.

977
00:40:04,960 --> 00:40:07,160
There was no one else around at the time.

978
00:40:07,760 --> 00:40:09,280
It was just Danni and Siyi.

979
00:40:09,670 --> 00:40:11,230
They were practicing extra,

980
00:40:11,230 --> 00:40:12,290
and this happened.

981
00:40:13,670 --> 00:40:16,200
Now look, both of them
are seriously injured.

982
00:40:17,810 --> 00:40:18,690
Our team's selection for this round

983
00:40:18,690 --> 00:40:19,950
is pretty much ruined.

984
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:21,710
I don't even know what kind of

985
00:40:21,710 --> 00:40:22,960
responsibility I'm going to face.

986
00:40:22,960 --> 00:40:24,690
The kids are in this condition.

987
00:40:26,070 --> 00:40:27,600
Why bring up the selection?

988
00:40:29,920 --> 00:40:30,650
Captain Lyu.

989
00:40:32,320 --> 00:40:33,280
Wang Danni

990
00:40:33,840 --> 00:40:36,330
said she missed her footing
after consecutive flips

991
00:40:36,330 --> 00:40:37,400
because Siyi kicked a gap

992
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:38,360
into the mat.

993
00:40:39,330 --> 00:40:41,860
Tibia, coccyx, lumbar spine—all fractured.

994
00:40:42,230 --> 00:40:42,890
Don't move.

995
00:40:43,070 --> 00:40:43,930
I'm not moving.

996
00:40:43,960 --> 00:40:44,960
Get out of the way.

997
00:40:46,530 --> 00:40:47,660
Danni, are you okay?

998
00:40:48,630 --> 00:40:49,290
Danni.

999
00:40:49,670 --> 00:40:50,190
Danni.

1000
00:40:56,480 --> 00:40:58,010
Our Siyi is just that clever

1001
00:40:59,590 --> 00:41:01,190
to nail the timing so perfectly?

1002
00:41:01,190 --> 00:41:02,190
Danni said it.

1003
00:41:02,880 --> 00:41:04,540
So whatever she says is right?

1004
00:41:04,630 --> 00:41:05,690
Then let me ask you,

1005
00:41:05,810 --> 00:41:06,880
did she notice the gap

1006
00:41:06,880 --> 00:41:08,280
before or after she fell?

1007
00:41:08,520 --> 00:41:09,150
If she found out beforehand,

1008
00:41:09,150 --> 00:41:10,480
why wasn't she careful?

1009
00:41:10,920 --> 00:41:11,800
If she found out afterwards,

1010
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:12,360
is it possible

1011
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:13,400
that when she fell,

1012
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,920
she just happened to hit that gap?

1013
00:41:14,920 --> 00:41:15,710
Or maybe

1014
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:17,380
the gap was already there?

1015
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:19,460
The kid's been with you since little.

1016
00:41:19,460 --> 00:41:20,280
Aside from time spent

1017
00:41:20,280 --> 00:41:20,890
with us,

1018
00:41:20,920 --> 00:41:22,670
she spent the most time with you.

1019
00:41:22,670 --> 00:41:23,800
Don't you know them?

1020
00:41:24,230 --> 00:41:24,840
Do you really think

1021
00:41:24,840 --> 00:41:26,770
our Siyi is that kind of sneaky kid?

1022
00:41:28,110 --> 00:41:29,570
Are you interrogating me?

1023
00:41:36,420 --> 00:41:37,070
How are these two kids

1024
00:41:37,070 --> 00:41:38,400
normally with each other?

1025
00:41:38,400 --> 00:41:39,190
I thought

1026
00:41:39,190 --> 00:41:40,400
they got along well.

1027
00:41:41,490 --> 00:41:42,190
Then what about

1028
00:41:42,190 --> 00:41:43,250
this snitching thing

1029
00:41:43,250 --> 00:41:44,380
our Siyi mentioned?

1030
00:41:44,970 --> 00:41:46,320
Perhaps it's because I criticized Danni

1031
00:41:46,320 --> 00:41:47,980
for dating a male team member.

1032
00:41:49,120 --> 00:41:50,400
That had nothing to do with Siyi.

1033
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:51,460
She didn't snitch.

1034
00:41:51,770 --> 00:41:52,760
Then why did she frame

1035
00:41:52,760 --> 00:41:53,670
our Siyi?

1036
00:41:54,070 --> 00:41:54,800
Frame?

1037
00:41:56,030 --> 00:41:56,710
Lyu,

1038
00:41:57,440 --> 00:41:58,710
you used to be a cop.

1039
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:01,590
Why would she frame her?

1040
00:42:01,840 --> 00:42:02,700
Let me tell you,

1041
00:42:03,640 --> 00:42:04,600
big frame-ups

1042
00:42:04,630 --> 00:42:06,550
often comes from very small motives.

1043
00:42:06,550 --> 00:42:07,630
You mean jealousy?

1044
00:42:09,590 --> 00:42:11,480
Danni couldn't possibly
be jealous of Siyi.

1045
00:42:11,480 --> 00:42:13,070
She's always been a top player.

1046
00:42:13,070 --> 00:42:14,800
They're not even in the same league.

1047
00:42:14,800 --> 00:42:16,660
The other way around is possible.

1048
00:42:17,840 --> 00:42:19,400
So you believe Wang Danni?

1049
00:42:19,720 --> 00:42:20,440
So you believe

1050
00:42:20,440 --> 00:42:21,910
that when Wang Danni was doing a flip,

1051
00:42:21,910 --> 00:42:23,000
she happened to see

1052
00:42:23,030 --> 00:42:23,940
Siyi move the mat

1053
00:42:23,940 --> 00:42:24,990
in a fraction of a second?

1054
00:42:24,990 --> 00:42:26,120
That's ridiculous!

1055
00:42:26,490 --> 00:42:27,590
Isn't she just looking for a scapegoat

1056
00:42:27,590 --> 00:42:28,720
for her own mistake?

1057
00:42:29,710 --> 00:42:30,590
Mr. Lyu,

1058
00:42:31,240 --> 00:42:31,920
I've been through something

1059
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:33,030
like this myself when I was young.

1060
00:42:33,030 --> 00:42:33,920
We were also teammates.

1061
00:42:33,920 --> 00:42:35,010
It was also a selection.

1062
00:42:35,010 --> 00:42:35,840
Someone put glass shards

1063
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:36,820
in my shoes.

1064
00:42:37,160 --> 00:42:38,320
That's why I'm stuck here dealing

1065
00:42:38,320 --> 00:42:39,980
with all this messy stuff now.

1066
00:42:40,710 --> 00:42:42,120
So you believe Wang Danni?

1067
00:42:42,120 --> 00:42:42,800
So you believe

1068
00:42:42,800 --> 00:42:43,670
our Lyu Siyi

1069
00:42:43,690 --> 00:42:45,760
is the same kind of scum
you ran into back then?

1070
00:42:45,760 --> 00:42:47,090
I don't believe anyone.

1071
00:42:47,230 --> 00:42:49,430
But I'm keeping that possibility open.

1072
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:52,150
You can go solve the case.

1073
00:42:52,150 --> 00:42:53,950
Isn't that your old profession?

1074
00:42:59,360 --> 00:43:00,090
Don't worry.

1075
00:43:01,280 --> 00:43:02,360
There's no case I can't solve.
